      "notes": "## Idea\n\nUnroll the chain reads by position instead of by chain, so each level reads one contiguous run of disclosed words.\n\n## Result\n\n6410 cycles. The guard per chain step is now two instructions.\n\n## Next\n\nThe level-major order forces a guard on every chain at every level; a chain-major graph would allow a jump table."
